    <briefdescription>
<para>Optional parameters shared across <ref refid="namespaceSpiceQL" kindref="compound">SpiceQL</ref> API calls. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Groups the options that most api functions accept so new options can be added in one place instead of to every function signature. Defaults match the defaults of the individual parameters they replace.</para>
<para>Converts to and from nlohmann::json (json j = options; j.get&lt;QueryOpts&gt;()). Keys missing from the json keep their defaults and unrecognized keys are ignored, so a new field only needs to be added here and to the NLOHMANN_DEFINE_TYPE call below. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
